900	   * (a decorator name can appear as a substring of another), so callers must
901	   * still exact-check `node.decorators.includes(decorator)`. Exists so the
902	   * kotlin expect/actual synthesizer never materializes the whole node table
903	   * the way `getAllNodes().filter(...)` did — that array alone OOM'd Node's
904	   * default heap on a 2M-node graph (#1212).
