1107	  /**
1108	   * Heal a long-lived connection whose `.codegraph/` was removed and recreated
1109	   * at the same path (a worktree recreated, or `rm -rf .codegraph` + re-init)
1110	   * before handing it to a tool. Otherwise the daemon keeps serving the
1111	   * pre-removal snapshot from its now-unlinked file handle until restart — and
1112	   * because the daemon registry is keyed by path, a same-path recreate routes
1113	   * new clients straight back to this same stale daemon (#925). The check is one
1114	   * stat() and a no-op unless the inode actually changed; it never throws into a
1115	   * tool call.
1116	   */
