2210	   *
2211	   * A method the agent named that resolves to a large same-name family whose
2212	   * definers overwhelmingly implement/extend ONE supertype is a runtime dispatch:
2213	   * the concrete target is chosen at runtime from N implementations, so no single
2214	   * static edge is "the answer" — the implementations ARE the continuations. We
2215	   * announce the supertype, its TRUE implementer count, and a few concrete targets,
