2281	    }
2282	    if (notes.length === 0) return '';
2283	    return [
2284	      '**Interface dispatch (a named method has many implementations)**',
2285	      '',
2286	      ...notes,
2287	      '',
2288	      '> The method above is dispatched at runtime to one of the listed implementations (a registry / plugin / strategy interface) — there is no single static caller→callee edge; the implementations ARE the continuations. To follow one, run codegraph_explore on a listed target.',
