2424	   * This is the ranking signal text search (FTS/bm25) CANNOT provide, and it's
2425	   * codegraph's home turf: relevance by STRUCTURE, not words. A file whose
2426	   * symbols are call-connected to the matched cluster accrues walk mass and
2427	   * ranks high; a lone TEXT match — e.g. `LensSwitcher.swift` matched the word
